# Claude Code configuration. This repository deliberately tracks none of it:
# the team's lives in the PithTech-Workspace profile and is symlinked in, and
# an outside contributor's is their own. Without this, a contributor who uses
# Claude Code and does not have the workspace would have nothing stopping them
# committing their local config - they have no .git/info/exclude from `ws link`.
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
